        <p>
          From concept to completion, MEIYU<sup
            style="font-size:0.65em;color:#C0A882;">®</sup
          > delivers precision-engineered aluminum ceiling &amp; wall systems built
          for performance and lasting aesthetics.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="solutions-grid-bronze">
        <div class="card-bronze">
          <img
            src="https://file.meiyualuminum.com/home/custom-aluminum-single-panel-design-factory-installation-building-facade.webp"
            alt="Custom aluminum single panel design showcase including technical drawings, factory production, shipping, on-site installation by worker on suspended platform, and completed building facade in grey metallic finish"
            class="card-img-bronze"
            loading="lazy"
            width="720"
            height="480"
          />
          <div class="card-body-bronze">
            <span class="card-tag-bronze">Customization</span>
            <h3>Aluminum Panel &amp; Batten Custom Systems</h3>
