              and civic architecture, with full support for custom dimensions
              and profiles.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Multi-spec sizing, manufactured to drawing</li>
              <li>
                Versatile finishes &mdash; PVDF / powder coating available
              </li>
              <li>Compliant with international building material standards</li>
            </ul>
            <button
