          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-bronze card-highlight-bronze">
          <img
            src="https://file.meiyualuminum.com/home/meiyu-engineer-architectural-3d-modeling-laser-scanner-construction-site.webp"
            alt="MEIYU engineer in safety vest and hard hat reviewing a high-precision 3D building model on a laptop at a construction site with a 3D laser scanner on tripod"
            class="card-img-bronze"
            loading="lazy"
            width="720"
            height="480"
          />
          <div class="card-body-bronze">
            <span class="card-tag-bronze">Engineering</span>
            <h3>High-Precision 3D Modeling Support</h3>
            <p>
              From prototype samples to on-site technical guidance, our
              engineering team leverages high-precision 3D models to support
              every stage of project delivery and installation.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>High-Precision 3D Modeling &amp; Clash Detection</li>
              <li>BIM Coordination &amp; Data Delivery</li>
              <li>Full Project Lifecycle Technical Support</li>
            </ul>
            <button
              type="button"
              class="card-cta-bronze"
              data-open-inquiry-modal>Request 3D Modeling</button
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-bronze">
          <img
            src="https://file.meiyualuminum.com/home/south-gate-tower-aluminum-single-panel-curtain-wall-construction-drawing-3d-render.webp"
            alt="South Gate Tower architectural drawing set showing north facade elevation, aluminum single panel curtain wall construction details, exploded axonometric view, and 3D rendered exterior perspective"
            class="card-img-bronze"
            loading="lazy"
            width="720"
            height="480"
          />
          <div class="card-body-bronze">
            <span class="card-tag-bronze">Core Competence</span>
            <h3>Expert Shop Drawing Capabilities</h3>
